## Create User in Azure AD (Entra ID)

### Objective
To Disable and Delete the account in Azure Active Directory.

### Steps Performed
1. Logged into Azure Portal
2. Navigated to Microsoft Entra ID
3. Selected Users → Select User Name
4. Click Delete
5. Verified user Deletion

